    <p>@L["There is no official support through Tungsten Automation Support. Please contact the author named in the catalog; answers are voluntary and without guaranteed response times."]</p>
    <p>@L["To the extent permitted by law, Tungsten Automation accepts no liability for damage, data loss or downtime caused by installing or using these plugins. Each plugin is the responsibility of its author."]</p>
